{"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"PSReader"}],"title":"Edition Platforms","roleHeading":"Concept"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Know which PageSuite system serves your editions, what that means for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your app, and why some API names say “feed” or “replica”.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PageSuite serves editions from two systems:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"current edition system","type":"text"}]},{"text":" serves every kind of edition: classic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PDF editions laid out like the printed paper, responsive HTML editions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and editions that mix the two. Both the prebuilt UI and a custom UI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"show every edition on it. These docs call them editions, and say “on","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current system” where the system matters."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"legacy replica system","type":"text"}]},{"text":" is the previous generation. It serves","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"classic PDF editions only, and only the prebuilt UI shows them. These","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"docs call them legacy replica editions. If you call your editions"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“print replicas”, that describes the classic PDF look, which either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system can serve; see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms#Telling-Which-System-a-Publication-Is-On","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Current system"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Legacy replica system","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Edition looks"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Classic PDF, responsive HTML, mixed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Classic PDF"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Prebuilt UI","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Custom UI"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Identifier"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Publication GUID"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replica publication GUID"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"“Classic PDF” and “responsive” describe how an edition looks. “Current”","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and “legacy replica” describe which system serves it. A classic PDF","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edition can be on either system, and on the current system it works with","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a custom UI like any other edition. Many API names call the current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system “feed”, its old name; see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms#Historic-API-Names"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"reader-classic-pdf","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"reader-responsive","type":"image"}]}]}],"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Telling-Which-System-a-Publication-Is-On","text":"Telling Which System a Publication Is On","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A publication GUID and a replica publication GUID look alike, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value won’t tell you. The label does: PageSuite supplies a “publication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GUID” for a title on the current system and a “replica publication GUID”"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for one on the legacy system. If you’re not sure which you were given,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ask your PageSuite account manager. A title that moved from the legacy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system to the current one has both, and they’re different values. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Identifiers"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You don’t always need to know:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A dynamic archive, "},{"code":".dynamicArchive(_:shortcode:config:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", reads each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publication’s system from its shortcode’s configuration and shows it the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right way."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With a GUID in hand, ask "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedEditionService"},{"type":"text","text":" for its archive. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions come back, the publication is on the current system, and both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sides can show it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let service = FeedEditionService(accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\")","let archive = try await service.publishedEditions(publicationGUID: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\")"],"copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[],"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A replica publication GUID has no archive on the current system, so"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the call throws an error. An error or an empty archive doesn’t prove a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"title is legacy, though: a publication on the current system that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hasn’t published anything yet has no editions either, and a mistyped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GUID or the wrong account GUID throws the same error. Check with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PageSuite before you treat a title as legacy.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"At runtime, analytics events tell the systems apart: editions on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current system report ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feedEdition…"},{"text":" events, and replica editions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replica…"},{"text":" events. See ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The core SDK has no replica path. To build a custom UI for a title that’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still on the legacy system, ask PageSuite about moving it to the current"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"What-Differs-in-the-Prebuilt-UI","text":"What Differs in the Prebuilt UI","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The prebuilt UI shows replica editions alongside editions on the current"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system. Where they behave differently, the prebuilt guides say so in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"callout marked “Replica”. The differences, in short:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Archives and kiosks."}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".replicaArchive(guid:)"},{"type":"text","text":" lists a replica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publication’s editions, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".replicaPublicationKiosk(publications:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gathers several, each a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskReplicaPublication"},{"type":"text","text":". See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Embedding-Prebuilt-Screens"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Opening an edition directly."}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" opens"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editions on the current system only. Replica editions open from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carousel and the prebuilt screens. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Presenting-the-Prebuilt-Reader"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Replica editions open in the legacy replica reader,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"configured through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/LegacyReaderConfiguration","type":"reference"},{"text":", or in the reader that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editions on the current system use.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader","type":"reference"},{"text":" chooses; it defaults to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the legacy reader for now and will default to the modern reader in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"future release. See ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Customizing-the-Reader-Screen","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delegates."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" The paywall, share, and audio delegates have methods for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replica editions:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallDelegate\/paywallViewControllerForAction(openReplicaEdition:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ShareDelegate\/shareContext(forSpread:inReplicaEdition:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/AudioDelegate\/playAudio(forSpread:inReplicaEdition:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", among others.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Sharing"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Text-to-Speech"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Analytics.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" Replica editions report ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replica…"},{"text":" events in place of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feedEdition…"},{"text":" ones, with their own contexts. See ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Search."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Replica publications are searched through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReplicaSearchService","type":"reference"},{"text":", which finds pages only, in one publication per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Search","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Historic-API-Names","text":"Historic API Names"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some API names use older words for the systems and for the classic PDF"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"look. They’re part of the shipped API and stay as they are.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Feed” means the current system."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" “Feed” is the current system’s old","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"name, and many of its APIs carry it. It doesn’t describe a format or a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"look: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedEditionService","type":"reference"},{"text":" fetches a classic PDF edition as readily as","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a responsive one, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" shows both. The same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holds for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".feedArchive"},{"type":"text","text":" sections, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskFeedPublication","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedSearchService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"feedEdition…"},{"type":"text","text":" analytics events, such as"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/EventChannel\/AnalyticsEvent\/feedEditionLaunch(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":". Where these docs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"say “feed edition”, they’re naming one of these APIs or setting the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current system against the legacy one.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some “replica” names mean the classic PDF look."}]},{"text":" A few names on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current system say “replica” for a classic PDF edition’s printed-page","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"look, not for the legacy system:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEEdition\/isReplicaEdition()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for a classic PDF edition,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose PDF pages pair into facing spreads.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage\/type","isActive":true},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replica_pdf_page"},{"text":" is a PDF","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"page; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPage\/isPDF","isActive":true},{"text":" covers it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/EventChannel\/AnalyticsEvent\/feedEditionReplicaView(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" fires when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the user views a PDF page.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Everywhere else, “replica” in an API name means the legacy replica","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system: ","type":"text"},{"code":".replicaArchive(guid:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskReplicaPublication","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReplicaSearchService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ReaderConfiguration\/useLegacyReplicaReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"replica…","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" analytics events, and the delegate methods that take a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replica edition.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Editions-and-Content","title":"Editions and Content","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Identifiers","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/The-Edition-Model"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/edition-platforms"]},{"traits"